WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.840
Is that the Kremlin?

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.090
Yes! To be more specific, it's the Moscow Kremlin!

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:45.760
A lot of Russian-style cathedrals and
palaces are gathered together there,

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:48.420
as well as the Russian government's Cabinet!

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.760
And the fact that it's in sight means...

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.520
Yep! A little bit further, and
we'll be at the Tournament arena!

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.660
At last.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:57.050
Yeah. I can't wait!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.740
What's this?

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.020
So many people!

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:09.610
Look, everyone's holding Beys!

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.590
So they're all Bladers?

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:15.080
Yes, and they don't all appear to be Russian.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.730
They came from all over the world to see the Finals...

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:20.610
Really? Everyone's so pumped for it!

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.120
Okay!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:22.690
Takao!

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:28.290
Hey, guys! We're gonna do our best
in there, so keep your eyes peeled!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:33.290
Kai's Decision

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:39.780
I'll go see to the formalities, then.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.340
We're counting on you.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.080
Thanks for all your support!

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:47.670
He's already so far gone...

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.520
Gotta keep the fans happy!

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:55.160
I see you've made it, worms.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.390
Are we already looking for your graves?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.320
What was that?!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.090
Wait!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.200
Rei...

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.770
Don't make any sudden movements. Look at them!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.040
Don't you sense that bloodlust?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:12.630
Backing down?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.600
What?!

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:14.800
Leave them be.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:19.680
They may become a glorious sacrifice for Borg.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.830
Yes, their sacrifice shall be made <i>here</i>.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.680
Your cemetery a stadium.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:29.770
And when all is said and done,
world domination will be all but ours!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.520
Hold up!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.870
I don't care how tough you guys are.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.760
We won't let you get away with this!

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.790
Mark my words! We <i>will</i> take you down!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.790
What's wrong?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.390
That's my grandfather.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.700
Huh? But that's—

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.430
Soichirou Hiwatari.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.190
Borg's mastermind?!

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:15.650
What's more, <i>he's</i> the one that played me like a pawn in his plans.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.960
How do I put this?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.360
He looked incredibly intimidating.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.330
He's different from the others we've faced.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.320
Tsk. What's the point in getting scared now?

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:39.120
Hey! More importantly, we gotta decide who's up!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.300
Alrighty! I call going first!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:45.020
This time, I wanna beat their faces in!

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.240
Jeez...

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.270
Even at a time like this, Takao's up and at 'em!

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.490
Right, then. I'll take the first round.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.060
Wait.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.150
Let <i>me</i> play in the first round.

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.360
He's right.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.560
It might be for the best to lead
with Kai, our strongest player.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.590
I'd like for us to come out of the gate running.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.830
But Kai's never the type to speak up like that...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.670
Maybe 'cause it's your grandfather?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.000
Nothing you guys need to worry about.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.550
Gotcha. I'll let you have the first match!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.390
Then I'll be playing in the second round.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:24.500
Takao will go third, since he
got a head-start with the Euros.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.610
Okay!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:26.900
So that's that.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:31.370
Don't forget Ralf's advice, everyone.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:35.920
Don't forget that our friendship
can become a power to surpass Borg's!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.940
We've been through a lot, but today is finally the day.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:51.930
Let's give this one our all!

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:53.340
Yeah!

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:02.750
The Beyblade World Championship finals that
you've all been waiting for are about to begin!

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:06.640
Who will stand on top of the world?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.890
The BBA? Or...

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.470
the Russian Team?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.740
As always, there are three players on each team!

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:18.080
It's a best-of-three, so the first player
with two wins will take the match!

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:23.010
But this time, our schedule
allows for only one match per day!

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:24.940
Now, get ready for some great battles!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.280
Let the battle of the century begin!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.220
Here we go.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.190
Indeed.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.100
I am sure they can...

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.100
You can do it! BBA!

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.600
It has been <i>ages</i>.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.050
Yes, it's been quite some time, Mr. Hiwatari.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.620
At last, the time I've long awaited has come.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.100
A time that will make my vision a reality.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.660
Those boys will stop your vision in its tracks.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.500
Do you really think so?

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:13.380
Until next time.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.020
So that's Hiwatari, eh?

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.530
What a fearsome man...

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.910
Just by the looks of him, Dad?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:24.800
Yep.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.220
A man of the sword like myself can tell.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.900
He's got bad vibes emanating from all over!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.610
The first battle!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.250
Kai from the BBA Team, versus...

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.190
Sergey, from the Russian team!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:44.990
Borg...

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.740
And so... Beystadium, open!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.810
The Beystadium for the first battle...

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.220
is the Black Sea Stadium!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:01.530
Two-thirds of the surface area is water!

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.920
Fall in, and the battle's over!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.880
How will you battle on these tight harbor sections?

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.720
It's gonna be tough to take your opponent on!

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.270
Will you be staritng us off, then?

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:14.110
The weakling who ran from Borg.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:16.720
Your Sacred Beast is mine.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.560
Supposing you can even take it.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:22.330
You, a weakling who can't even run from Borg.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.730
Are you ready?!

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:29.290
Three!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:30.490
Two!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.280
One!

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:33.330
Go Shoot!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.320
Sergey and Seaborg!

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.880
They're the ones who took my Sacred Beast!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.960
Kai! Go wild on 'em!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.720
Go, Dranzer!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.340
This is an intense clash!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.450
But Dranzer has the first-move advantage!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.320
Good going, Kai!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.920
Uh-oh! Seaborg's down in the ocean!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.290
Has this battle already been lost?!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.320
What's his game?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:15.820
What?

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.380
W-What's happening here?

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:22.830
One heck of a spiral is brewing
in the wake of Seaborg's fall!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:25.890
Look at that!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.030
A huge tidal wave is headed for the harbor!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:40.050
Seaborg's still spinning?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.800
This is my special move.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.500
Voda Impact!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.370
What?!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.990
My artificial Sacred Beast is a whale.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.490
It can freely manipulate seawater!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.700
Fall into the depths of the ocean!

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.540
What an amazing battle!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.170
Can Dranzer escape the tidal wave?

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.770
We won't let you go!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.480
With such a focus on offense,

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.360
your defense is left wide open!

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.290
That's it, Kai!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.210
You're finished!

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.930
Flame Saber!!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.950
W-What?!

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.720
The Flame Saber...

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:42.950
But how..?

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.570
Look at that!

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.190
Seaborg is still standing!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.940
Sergey of the Russian Team wins the first set!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:05.770
Like I said before, anyone who runs from Borg is <i>weak</i>!

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:22.850
I have won.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.470
But you still took too long.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.340
Finish the next set in half the time.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:31.670
Sir!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.230
Our next set will be in thirty minutes.

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:36.970
Players, use this time to make adjustments!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.640
He lost the first set.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.370
A sea Stadium with a whale Sacred Beast...

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.720
I bet they stacked the deck.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.880
Now that you mention it,

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.740
I did hear that Volkov built this arena...

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.980
He has no regard for subtlety.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:54.640
Yet it's true that their Sacred Beasts are strong.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.720
Sergey's Sacred Beast whipped up those tides.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:59.870
That wasn't any ordinary water.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.670
It manifests from his Sacred Beast's power.

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:06.950
Otherwise, there's no way it could
have extinguished that Flame Saber.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.880
So he lost because of the
Sacred Beasts' power differential.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.850
Seaborg is superior.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:16.050
Perhaps even more than we'd imagined.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:19.090
So if this keeps up, Kai will..!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.120
Kai...

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.000
I need to rethink my strategy.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.170
Leave me be.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.310
S-Sure.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.490
I lost!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:37.240
Dranzer should have unleashed its full power!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:40.040
How pathetic!

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:43.880
Seaborg is far more powerful than Dranzer.

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:47.720
I imagine that no matter what strategy I come up with...

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:52.600
Who's there?!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.580
It's been far too long.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.940
Since the time following the American Finals...

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.310
What do you want?

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.960
Did you come here to laugh at me?

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.560
Quite the opposite.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.260
I came to lend you a hand.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.630
Lend me a hand?

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.200
What's so funny?

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.660
Don't make me laugh!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:17.420
You shoved me into Borg when
I was young and used me as a pawn!

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.460
Now you want to help?!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.650
I have a gift for you.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.670
Using this, you can win.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.150
Black Dranzer!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:37.280
More specifically, a clone of the original Bit,
made with state-of-the-art technology.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:43.130
By merely attaching this Bit,
Dranzer will become considerably stronger.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:46.090
Naturally, you'd be able to use Black Suzaku.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.080
I'm done with that Bey.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.680
I will never use it again.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.290
But you acknowledge its strength, no?

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.900
With this much power, you can easily beat Sergey.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:58.500
Why give it to me?

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:02.990
I aim to obtain every Sacred Beast in the world.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:06.640
I don't care if you do it or if Borg does.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.550
Who wins doesn't make a difference to me.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.220
But with the way it's looking now,

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.900
I find you much easier to rely upon.

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.640
What's that supposed to mean?

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:23.110
You can't stand the shame of losing to Sergey.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:26.640
You'd do anything for more power.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.010
Get to the point!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.460
Use this to beat Sergey!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.910
In exchange,

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:34.610
you will take the BBA's Sacred Beasts.

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:36.240
What?!

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:40.280
You can attack the BBA's members from the inside

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.620
and steal their their
Sacred Beasts!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.220
Are you...

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.320
telling me to backstab my friends?!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:47.720
You can do it.

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:49.960
With the way you are now...

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.570
You must want power over friendship.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.460
Our Hiwatari blood yearns for it!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.760
Should we stop?

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.800
I'm sure Kai prefers to be alone.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.870
I can't just leave him.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.690
I want to cheer him up a little.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.130
Kai!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.850
Kai, what are you..?

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.120
Hey, Kai!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:27.660
Okay! Time for the second set!

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:38.720
Wait, Kai! What was that just now?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.690
Let go.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.870
That Bit...

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.100
Kai...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.600
Now, the Bladers are back!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.830
I'll beat you in half the time of the first set!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.990
What?! Black Dranzer's Bit?!

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:13.040
Yes. I think his grandfather gave it to him.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.250
But...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.130
If he uses that Bit, Kai will be drawn in again.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:21.920
He'll become a dark-hearted Kai
again, obsessed with power!

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.080
Are you ready?

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:24.920
Three!

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:25.670
Two!

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:26.690
One!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.260
Go Shoot!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.330
Excellent. With that Bit, you will become the best.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.780
Defeat Sergey!

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:46.710
When you do, your soul will once again belong to me!

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:50.710
That will be when the BBA crumbles before me.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.200
I won't even need to use Borg.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.800
So he's trying to keep Seaborg

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.680
away from the water with an assault of small attacks?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:06.960
In that case..!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.010
Go, Seaborg!

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:21.310
Seaborg dives into the sea!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.350
Is he going for the Voda Impact?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:28.650
Here it is.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.060
Seaborg!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.880
Voda Impact!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.620
Now, Kai.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.040
Kai, don't!

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.170
Release your dark power!

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.270
Black Suzaku will flap its wings,

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:52.970
and his Bey will soar!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.610
Dranzer!!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.820
W-What?!

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.290
You fool!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.650
Kai!

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:20.670
I never planned on using
Black Dranzer's Bit from the start!

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.160
You dare disobey me, Kai?

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.270
I am...

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.290
not your toy!

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.520
You brat!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.770
Kai...

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:34.080
We've got your back.

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:37.710
He's obviously stronger than me.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.370
Before all this, I would have chosen power,

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.540
even if it meant becoming his toy.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.900
But I'm not like I used to be.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:48.220
I have my friends now.

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.050
Even if the battle ends...

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:53.020
For my friends. <i>With</i> my friends...

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.730
I choose to fight.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.150
Go, Dranzer!!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.740
That foolish attack again?!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.630
No, it's not the same.

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.010
Look at Suzaku's shine.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:12.140
Like how Takao unleashed Seiryu's
dormant abilities, Kai is doing the same.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.780
He fights believing in his friends.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.820
Flame Saber!!

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:30.300
Seaborg!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.700
Dranzer...

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.870
Seaborg is the last one standing!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.150
Which means that

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:08.910
the Russian Team wins the first match!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.540
That makes one.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.810
Damn you, Kai! No second chances.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:27.160
I will eliminate you alongside the BBA!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:30.480
And then I will obtain the Sacred Beasts...

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.990
I lost, huh?

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:35.220
Yet I have no regrets.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:39.270
As of today, I am no longer his plaything.

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:40.380
Kai.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.520
Nice battle.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.770
I'll get Suzaku back for you.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:49.000
Dranzer was glowing.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:53.180
That's the light of a power born
from believing in your friends.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:56.900
You're stronger than you've ever been, Kai.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:21:02.120
Kai, your feelings are in our hands.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:05.970
We'll turn those feelings into
power, and become even stronger!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.120
Of course you will.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.930
Rei, it's up to you. We're down one match,

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.640
so this is it for us.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.260
Yeah. Watch me win the next one!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:19.910
Sergey won, but he took far too long.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.800
Battle like that again,

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.260
and you won't think about
returning to the Abbey ever again.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.210
Yes, sir!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:01.680
According to my analysis, the next match,

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:04.810
Rei VS Boris, will be unbelievable!

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:08.660
Boris, the brutal, cold-blooded member of Borg,

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:12.210
unleashes a strategy to directly harm Rei's body!

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:16.560
No! If this keeps up... Rei! Rei!

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:18.330
It'll be goodbye!

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:20.750
Next time: Byakko's Cry.

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:24.450
Rei, we will never forget you..!
